      Q. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَوْمَعَ الثَّرِيدَةَ</span></b>  <i>He made the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثريدة</span> [or
<i>mess of crumbled bread with broth</i>] <i>slender in the
head,</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, O, K,) <i>and pointed therein;</i>
(Ibn-'Abbád, O;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَمَّعَهَا</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صومع بِنَأءَهُ</span> <i>He made his building high.</i>
(Seer, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صومع الشَّىْءَ</span> <i>He collected
together the thing.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, O, K.)

